    "Taps are extra package repositories, usually on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Taps sind zusätzliche Paket-Repositorys, meist auf GitHub."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Los taps son repositorios de paquetes adicionales, normalmente en GitHub."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les taps sont des dépôts de paquets supplémentaires, généralement sur GitHub."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "タップは、通常 GitHub 上にある追加のパッケージリポジトリです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tap 是额外的软件包仓库，通常位于 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal & Shell": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Terminal & Shell"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Terminal y shell"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Terminal et shell"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ターミナルとシェル"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "终端与 Shell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal will run:\n%@\n\nIt asks for your administrator password there; Brewlight never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das Terminal führt aus:\n%@\n\nEs fragt dort nach deinem Administratorpasswort; Brewlight sieht es nie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El Terminal ejecutará:\n%@\n\nAllí te pedirá tu contraseña de administrador; Brewlight nunca la ve."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le Terminal exécutera :\n%@\n\nIl vous y demandera votre mot de passe administrateur ; Brewlight ne le voit jamais."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ターミナルで次を実行します：\n%@\n\n管理者パスワードはターミナルで尋ねられます。Brewlight がそれを見ることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "终端将运行：\n%@\n\n它会在终端中要求输入管理员密码；Brewlight 不会看到密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer is Homebrew's official signed package from GitHub. You'll be asked for your password by macOS, not by Brewlight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das Installationsprogramm ist das offizielle, signierte Homebrew-Paket von GitHub. Nach deinem Passwort fragt macOS, nicht Brewlight."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El instalador es el paquete oficial y firmado de Homebrew en GitHub. Es macOS quien te pide la contraseña, no Brewlight."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le programme d’installation est le paquet officiel et signé de Homebrew sur GitHub. C’est macOS qui vous demandera votre mot de passe, pas Brewlight."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "インストーラは GitHub 上の Homebrew 公式の署名済みパッケージです。パスワードを尋ねるのは Brewlight ではなく macOS です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "安装程序是 Homebrew 在 GitHub 上发布的官方签名安装包。询问密码的是 macOS，而不是 Brewlight。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then deletes the %lld checked items permanently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Löscht dann die %lld markierten Objekte endgültig."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Después elimina definitivamente los %lld elementos marcados."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Supprime ensuite définitivement les %lld éléments cochés."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "その後、チェックした %lld 項目を完全に削除します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "然后永久删除勾选的 %lld 项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then moves the %lld checked items to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Legt dann die %lld markierten Objekte in den Papierkorb."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Después mueve a la papelera los %lld elementos marcados."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Met ensuite les %lld éléments cochés à la corbeille."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "その後、チェックした %lld 項目をゴミ箱に移動します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "然后将勾选的 %lld 项移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files are deleted permanently (not moved to the Trash); Homebrew downloads them again if it needs them. The installed package isn't touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Diese Dateien werden endgültig gelöscht (nicht in den Papierkorb gelegt); Homebrew lädt sie bei Bedarf erneut. Das installierte Paket bleibt unberührt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Estos archivos se eliminan definitivamente (no van a la papelera); Homebrew los vuelve a descargar si hace falta. El paquete instalado no se toca."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ces fichiers sont supprimés définitivement (pas mis à la corbeille) ; Homebrew les retélécharge au besoin. Le paquet installé n’est pas touché."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これらのファイルは完全に削除されます（ゴミ箱には移動しません）。必要になれば Homebrew が再ダウンロードします。インストール済みのパッケージには影響しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这些文件会被永久删除（不移到废纸篓）；需要时 Homebrew 会重新下载。已安装的软件包不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These were installed as dependencies and nothing installed needs them any more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Diese wurden als Abhängigkeiten installiert und werden von nichts Installiertem mehr benötigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Se instalaron como dependencias y ya nada de lo instalado las necesita."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ils ont été installés comme dépendances et plus rien d’installé n’en a besoin."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これらは依存関係としてインストールされ、今はどのインストール済みパッケージからも必要とされていません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "它们作为依赖被安装，现在已没有已安装的软件需要它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Drittanbieter"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De terceros"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tiers"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "サードパーティ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第三方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party taps are not reviewed by Homebrew. Their formulae run code on your Mac when installed — only add taps you trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Taps von Drittanbietern werden von Homebrew nicht geprüft. Ihre Formeln führen bei der Installation Code auf deinem Mac aus – füge nur Taps hinzu, denen du vertraust."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Homebrew no revisa los taps de terceros. Sus fórmulas ejecutan código en tu Mac al instalar; añade solo taps de confianza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les taps tiers ne sont pas vérifiés par Homebrew. Leurs formules exécutent du code sur votre Mac à l’installation — n’ajoutez que des taps de confiance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "サードパーティのタップは Homebrew の審査を受けていません。そのフォーミュラはインストール時に Mac 上でコードを実行します。信頼できるタップだけを追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第三方 tap 未经 Homebrew 审核。其 formula 会在安装时在你的 Mac 上运行代码——只添加你信任的 tap。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file doesn't look like a Brewfile.": {
      "localizations": {
